{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planetary 3D Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a fast-paced interplanetary journey as a swift, agile sphere. Explore unique worlds filled with challenging levels, deadly traps, enemies, and hidden secrets. Your goal: collect orbs while dodging danger and facing off against powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/b0d02fa6f806dcdccaabac90aabda522.poster.avif?t=1755204902\" width=666 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/b0d02fa6f806dcdccaabac90aabda522.webm?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/b0d02fa6f806dcdccaabac90aabda522.mp4?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill, Challenge and Permadeath</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master special abilities, take on intense challenges, and activate permadeath mode for the ultimate test of skill. Every planet is a battleground where only the fastest and sharpest survive. Precision and timing are your greatest allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/d62c824190a5c433c7a5ded650c929b7.poster.avif?t=1755204902\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/d62c824190a5c433c7a5ded650c929b7.webm?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/d62c824190a5c433c7a5ded650c929b7.mp4?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize, Compete and Replay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock skins, track your stats, and dive into challenges that push your limits. With tons of levels and nonstop action, Sphereverse delivers a thrilling and highly replayable 3D platforming experience full of energy and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/2b521758eba43ef9570a9040aa7b59ba.poster.avif?t=1755204902\" width=674 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/2b521758eba43ef9570a9040aa7b59ba.webm?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/extras/2b521758eba43ef9570a9040aa7b59ba.mp4?t=1755204902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921310?t=1755204902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/98576d4a4e51c66937b3377702208a8ede2423fb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755204902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/fcbb10e39047cbd5a5cbf2b5c1ee3c9e787b4377/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755204902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921310/fcbb10e39047cbd5a5cbf2b5c1ee3c9e787b4377/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755204902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3928450,"description":""}],"d